{{also|arabia|Arábia|Arabía|Aràbia}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|Arabia}}, from {{der|en|grc|Ἀραβία}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/əˈɹeɪbiə/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|eɪbiə|lang=en}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[peninsula]] between the [[Red Sea]] and the [[Persian Gulf]]; includes [[Jordan]], [[Saudi Arabia]], [[Yemen]], [[Oman]], [[Qatar]], [[Bahrain]], [[Kuwait]], and the [[United Arab Emirates]].
# {{qualifier|broader sense}} The region within or adjacent to the [[Arabian Plate]]; [[Yemen]], [[Oman]], [[Qatar]], [[Bahrain]], [[Kuwait]], [[Iraq]], [[Saudi Arabia]], [[Jordan]], the [[Egyptian]] [[Sinai]], [[Palestine]] and the [[United Arab Emirates]].

